{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"function toBooleanPredicate(result): boolean;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/query/compiler/evaluators.ts#L79","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/db/src/query/compiler/evaluators.ts:79"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Converts a 3-valued logic result to a boolean for use in WHERE/HAVING filters.\nIn SQL, UNKNOWN (null) values in WHERE clauses exclude rows, matching false behavior."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"result","children":[{"type":"text","value":"result"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The 3-valued logic result: true, false, or null (UNKNOWN)"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"boolean"},{"type":"text","value":" | "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"null"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"boolean"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"true only if result is explicitly true, false otherwise"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Truth table:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"true → true (include row)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"false → false (exclude row)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"null (UNKNOWN) → false (exclude row, matching SQL behavior)"}]}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"result","text":"result","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction toBooleanPredicate(result): boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/query/compiler/evaluators.ts:79](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/query/compiler/evaluators.ts#L79)\n\nConverts a 3-valued logic result to a boolean for use in WHERE/HAVING filters.\nIn SQL, UNKNOWN (null) values in WHERE clauses exclude rows, matching false behavior.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### result\n\nThe 3-valued logic result: true, false, or null (UNKNOWN)\n\n`boolean` | `null`\n\n## Returns\n\n`boolean`\n\ntrue only if result is explicitly true, false otherwise\n\nTruth table:\n- true → true (include row)\n- false → false (exclude row)\n- null (UNKNOWN) → false (exclude row, matching SQL behavior)\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: toBooleanPredicate\ntitle: toBooleanPredicate\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction toBooleanPredicate(result): boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/query/compiler/evaluators.ts:79](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/query/compiler/evaluators.ts#L79)\n\nConverts a 3-valued logic result to a boolean for use in WHERE/HAVING filters.\nIn SQL, UNKNOWN (null) values in WHERE clauses exclude rows, matching false behavior.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### result\n\nThe 3-valued logic result: true, false, or null (UNKNOWN)\n\n`boolean` | `null`\n\n## Returns\n\n`boolean`\n\ntrue only if result is explicitly true, false otherwise\n\nTruth table:\n- true → true (include row)\n- false → false (exclude row)\n- null (UNKNOWN) → false (exclude row, matching SQL behavior)\n"}
